mous Five  Star five Diamond rating for 2022. with  27 stories overlooking the white sandy  beaches of Miami it literally sits at  the intersection of art fashion and  design you can pamper yourself with  their award-winning Spa dining one of  their many incredible restaurants and  its location is pretty ideal too just  steps away from the shops of the Miami  Beach Enclave a lot of elements make  this the ultimate luxury retreat in a  very vibrant City so of course as you  plan ahead for the year I will leave you  with three final tips on how to make the  most out of your travel dollars number  one book direct from Airlines to hotels  this is always the best way for the best  deals and the most flexibility number  two look to the bigger brands for Flash  sales and seasonal deals there's always  options out there and number three my  final tip get a trip on the books it's  been proven that having a vacation plan  actually makes people happier as they  know that they have something to look  forward to so plan a trip and get  excited for all the memories that you're  about to make in 2020
 

